		"create a receiving report" [shape=box]
		"file a copy for internal records" -> "create a receiving report"
		"confirm all documents have been amended" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" -> "confirm all documents have been amended"
		"store in paid invoice file" [shape=box]
		"confirm all documents have been amended" -> "store in paid invoice file"
	}
	START_NODE -> "file a copy for internal records"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"store in paid invoice file" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following description is about the account payable process. It begins when you file a copy for internal records. 
When filing a copy for internal records is completed, you need to create a receiving report.
After creating a receiving report, you need to confirm all documents have been amended.
After confirming all documents have been amended, you need to store in paid invoice file.
The process is now completed. 
"
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following description is about the accounts payable process, which begins when you file a copy of the internal records.
When a copy of a receipt is completed for internal records, you need to create a receiving report.
After creating a Receiving Report, you must confirm that all documents have been amended.
After confirming all documents have been amended, you must store invoice file in paid file.
The process is now concluded.
"
